From 4bd777d9384fa98a657433d19814df2b1f28bda7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 16:40:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(workplace): propose workplace booking suite (ADR 003,
 PRD, contracts)

Propose a new `workplace` suite for desk, room, parking and pool-vehicle
booking, grounded in the public Stadt Chemnitz desk-sharing tender
(TED 595241-2026).

- ADR 003 (PROPOSED): separate suite with `spaces` and `bookings`
  services; rejected extending appointments/core or accounting/asset.
- PRD (DRAFT): functional, non-functional and acceptance criteria;
  assumptions flagged pending review of the full tender documents.
- OpenAPI 0.1.0 contracts for spaces (sites, floors, calibrated plans,
  wall-graph geometry with derived rooms, zones, resources, bulk
  placement) and bookings (recurrence, group bookings, check-in and
  no-show release, policies, blocks, availability, utilisation).
- Register ADR 003 and the PRD in docs/authority.json; wiki log entry.

No crates, ports, Helm, Tilt or deployment profiles are added; these
follow CONTRIBUTING.md once ADR 003 is accepted.
